# Name affected products with links

When a handbook/catalog item (size chart, material, etc.) is **in use**, **blocked from delete**, or **migrated/replaced**:

- Always list the **exact products** involved (name + internal code if useful).
- Always include a **clickable link** to each product: `/products/{id}` (markdown: `[Name](/products/{id})`).
- Do not only say “N виробів” — name them.
- Same rule for orders or other entities when the action touches them: name + path link.
